      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fox_Island%2C_Washington",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The 1,981‑foot Fox Island Bridge, built by the Washington State Toll Bridge Authority, once charged tolls for both vehicles and pedestrians.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
